********************************************
*
*BZX84-B9V1
*
*Nexperia
*
*Voltage regulator diodes
*
*
*
*
* 
*
*IRmax = 0,5µA @ VR = 6V
*IZSM  = 3A    @ tp = 100µs
*VZmax = 9,28V @ IZ = 5mA
*
*
*
*
* 
*
*
*Package pinning does not match Spice model pinning.
*Package: SOT23 (TO-236AB)
*
*Package Pin 1: Anode
*Package Pin 2: not connected
*Package Pin 3: Cathode
*
*
*Extraction date (week/year): 03/2024
*Simulator: SPICE3
*
*******************************************
*#
.SUBCKT BZX84-B9V1 1 2
*
*The resistor R1 and the diode2   
*do not reflect physical devices 
*but improve only modeling in the 
*forward mode of operation.
*      
R1 1 2 5E+11
D1 1 2
+ DIODE1
D2 3 1
+ DIODE2
VZ 2 3 0.2
*
.MODEL DIODE1 D
+ IS = 5E-16
+ N = 1.03
+ BV = 8.676
+ IBV = 1E-09
+ RS = 0.45
+ CJO = 5.339E-11
+ VJ = 0.6
+ M = 0.33
+ FC = 0.5
+ TT = 0
+ EG = 1.1
+ XTI = 3
.MODEL DIODE2 D
+ IS = 1E-18
+ N = 12.8
+ RS = 40
.ENDS
*











